            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para verificar se um número é menor que outro número, usamos o <strong>operador de menor que</strong>, <code>&lt;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt; \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"2\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para verificar se um número é menor que outro número, usamos o operador de menor que, <code>&lt;</code>.</p><p>Complete uma comparação em que o número à esquerda seja menor que o número à direita.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;</code> seguido de <code>90</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
